sequenceDiagram
    participant Backend as LunaCore backend (Paper / NeoForge)
    participant Http as Velocity HTTP endpoint
    participant Registry as Backend status registry
    participant Stream as Registry stream (SSE)

    Note over Backend,Stream: on start — the mirror is empty, so the cursor asks for everything
    Backend->>Http: GET /api/heartbeat/stream
    Stream-->>Backend: event: snapshot (every row + epoch)
    Backend->>Http: GET /api/server-selector-config
    Http-->>Backend: selector layout (open-v8)

    loop every heartbeat.intervalSeconds
        Backend->>Http: POST /api/heartbeat/{server}?since=R&epoch=E
        Http->>Registry: upsert own status (new revision)
        Registry-->>Http: whole rows with revision > R
        Http-->>Backend: rows + epoch + registry revision
        Note right of Backend: the cursor advances only here — a stream event<br/>says nothing about rows still owed
        Backend->>Http: GET /server-selector-config (checksum-guarded)
    end

    Note over Registry,Backend: any change — another backend's heartbeat, a timeout sweep
    Registry-->>Stream: status changed
    Stream-->>Backend: event: row (whole row)
    Backend->>Backend: merge row, redraw open selector menus

    Note over Backend,Http: proxy restarted — the epoch no longer matches the cursor
    Backend->>Http: POST /api/heartbeat/{server}?since=R&epoch=(old)
    Http-->>Backend: fullSync=true, every row, new epoch
